# Image builds: no external-failure workarounds

Do not add tolerance, resilience, or defensive workarounds for transient external build/CI failures (GitHub Actions, apt mirrors, DNS, registries, flaky runners, etc.).

If the failure is external, leave the build path simple, fail clearly, and re-run the workflow after the environment recovers. Fix only real bugs in our Dockerfiles and scripts.

Rationale: [docs/image-build-external-failures.md](../../docs/image-build-external-failures.md)
